    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110247" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾰνέρ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σημασία</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. διὰ σάλπιγγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phot.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>disclosure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀπὸ τοῦ οἴνου φ. τοῦ λογισμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
					<u>Incred.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>manifestation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πνεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
					12.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				4.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astron.,
				<i>becoming visible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.Laod.
			</span></i> (?) in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				5(1).189
			</span></i>(pl.).</div>
